{#
    JS texts of the participant page (assets/controllers/compete_controller.js): one JSON object, keys = what the JS asks
    for. Plain texts with |trans (their %placeholders% filled in the browser), plural texts with browser_translation()
    (chosen by translation_choice.js). The checklist's detail texts are asked for as `check_<row>_<code>` - the codes of
    compete_flow.js checklistRows(). Pinned by tests/CompeteTextsTest.php.
    With live video (`video` not null - a media server configured) the `video_` texts follow; without it the JSON is the
    Phase 1 JSON, byte for byte.
#}
